                                                "sense_id": "8201f88c-8682-3f76-b62f-c08d225eeac9",
                                                "text": "Moreover, for the past two days Paul Manafort and other Trumpsters had aggressively insisted that there was no plagiarism, revealing the spokespeople of the Trump campaign as liars and hypocrites who modify their party line […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65d15535-fbef-4b5d-9bf6-f6a2a56a445a",
                                                "sense_id": "8201f88c-8682-3f76-b62f-c08d225eeac9",
                                                "text": "These Trumpsters were bamboozled into believing that all of the economic ills of our society can be attributed to the poor who depend on government assistance to survive."
                                            }
