                                                "sense_id": "a4f6ee08-d4b3-31ce-8486-ca3cd867b552",
                                                "text": "Phineas Taylor Barnum, godfather of the modern age of hot press and selfpromotion, was Donald's direct precursor, the man who anticipated the Trumpster more than a century before the Trumpster was born."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41c45767-d351-4dd0-bdf8-6113c8988fff",
                                                "sense_id": "a4f6ee08-d4b3-31ce-8486-ca3cd867b552",
                                                "text": "How long before he grew his thinning hair long enough to comb it over his receding hairline in the Trumpster's signature style?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a6bcffc-630d-4b4f-b868-250706bb53bf",
                                                "sense_id": "a4f6ee08-d4b3-31ce-8486-ca3cd867b552",
                                                "text": "This guy, who sounds like what we might call a “Scottish redneck”, adamantly refused to knuckle under to the Trumpster, and sell out, or even clean up his “eyesore” property."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
